\title{Basic type constructors}
\import{prelude}

\p{In this section, we describe informally the various type constructors available in Coln.}

\p{As we introduce each new type construction, we demonstrate the database schema produced by the Coln compiler, together with a valid instance of that schema. Click the "Example" heading to expand it. \mvrnote{forward link to more details}}

